            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>Mule transactions = 0.7% of dataset</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>— severe class imbalance requiring normalized analysis</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
