            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>Pending KYC = 4.5x mule rate</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>Æ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>vs Verified</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'> — Rejected accounts transacting at all is itself a red flag</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'>KYC Status</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'> = verification level of the account holder at time of transaction</run>
